					"font-size": {
						"type": "float",
						"value": 19
					},
					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "TEXTURE MATH\n\nThis is not so much a tutorial as an introduction.\nWe want you to be aware that textures are valid inputs for most math nodes.\n\nWhen you do these operations, the operation is applied to the color value of each pixel.\nDon't worry too much about this right now (or go experimenting!) we'll get back to this later.\nFor now, just know that it exists.\n"
					}
				},
