					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "MATH\n\nThis tutorial will cover some basic math nodes that can help you in your patching.\nDon't expect any complicated formulas or concepts, we're starting with the basics and we keep it practical. \nThis tutorial is meant to show you that math nodes can be used for both creative and design work."
