					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "ADD & SUBTRACT\n\nAllow us to go full elementary school and talk about addition and subtraction.\nThese two nodes can be used to add or subtract two data types with\/from each other.\n\nYou could use these nodes to add two colors from each other or reduce the opacity by subtracting a part of the opacity.\n\nAdd and Subtract are also useful in the context of positioning your content.\nIn this example we are taking a static pattern and adding a small amount or Perlin Noise to breathe life into the animation.\n"
					}
				},
